## 2. Accepted User Input

### A. One Sentinel task ZIP

### B. Platform information (any or all of)

- Original Directory Name
- Category
- Difficulty
- Task Tags
- Languages
- Metadata
- Source PR URL
- Base commit
- Model results
- Expert and junior time estimates

### C. A start instruction

Treat pasted platform information as **context that must be verified** against `task.toml`, repository content, languages, source PR/commit/issue, base commit, instruction, tests, oracle, run evidence, and current Ultra rules. Report mismatches. Do **not** blindly copy platform information.

